type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683149}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "073aa4c3-53d5-5a59-bd4c-84ab25680b3b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 5^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 5^{2 x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{5^{2 x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683109 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9546d0a3-3833-53ce-901a-acef02be3cae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683131}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9546d0a3-3833-53ce-901a-acef02be3cae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683131} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb3bbebe-f98e-5bb4-8c5b-2deaa93fe59e" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683154}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1898d626-72c7-56d3-8a6b-3c2da1bca302" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cdot 5^{x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cdot 5^{x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683110 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "902bd2d9-67e7-55f8-9cad-6d82c9c8e312" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1\\left(\\frac{5^{3 - x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683128}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "902bd2d9-67e7-55f8-9cad-6d82c9c8e312" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1\\left(\\frac{5^{3 - x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683128} :answer-field/id #uuid "408b5250-251d-5619-aa85-54f86ce3f0a1" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186683115}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "225f0b86-4c15-5153-ad4b-874bc11b2463" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\cdot 5^{3 - x^{3}} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 - x^{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(- 3 x^{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\cdot 5^{3 - x^{3}} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-1\\left(\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n-1\\left(\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=-1\\left(\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n-1\\left(\\frac{5^{3 - x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186683119 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choi